# Karma counts Swamps on resolution, after a Swamp is destroyed in response to its upkeep trigger (CR 608.2h).

[Bot1 Deck]
Strip Mine
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Karma
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x2
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Strip Mine.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Karma.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
? Bot1.Mana =
